### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Sign In (Use your Supabase user credentials)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "your_admin@example.com",
  "password": "your_password"
}

### Get Current User
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me

### Sign Out
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signout

### Refresh Token
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/refresh

###############################################
# Project Endpoints
###############################################

### Get All Projects (Public)
GET http://localhost:3000/projects

### Get Projects by Status (Public)
GET http://localhost:3000/projects?status=active

### Get Single Project (Public)
GET http://localhost:3000/projects/1

### Create New Project (Authenticated - Sign in first!)
POST http://localhost:3000/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Weather Platform",
  "description": "Centralized IoT platform that build specifically for weather stations",
  "tags": ["Nextjs", "Typescript", "Tailwind", "Shadcn", "AWS"],
  "link": "https://github.com/Itea-Lab/Weather-Platform",
  "project_img": "https://example.com/weather-platform.jpg",
  "status": "active"
}

### Create Another Project Example
POST http://localhost:3000/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Astral Nexus",
  "description": "A platform for sharing game contents",
  "tags": ["Vuejs", "Typescript", "Tailwind", "Elysia", "PostgreSQL", "Docker"],
  "link": "https://github.com/PancakesLmao/Astral-Nexus"
}

### Update Project (Authenticated)
PUT http://localhost:3000/projects/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Weather Platform",
  "description": "Updated description for the weather platform",
  "tags": ["Nextjs", "Typescript", "Tailwind", "AWS", "IoT"],
  "status": "completed"
}

### Delete Project (Authenticated)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/projects/1
